NOTE ON THE MODEL

This project configures third-party agents to run the MiniMax-M3.1-Flash model
through the NVIDIA NIM hosted catalog. Those services are governed by their own
terms (NVIDIA API Trial Terms of Service; NVIDIA Software and Model Evaluation
License) and by the MiniMax Community License for the base model. This license
covers only the scripts and documentation in this repository.
